Simulated integrations
----------------------

All integrations below are demo mocks. They do not connect to production
systems, request official data, or create legally significant operations:

- ЕГРЮЛ/ЕГРИП — company and sole-proprietor registry data;
- ФНС «Прозрачный бизнес» — revenue, headcount, taxes and tax debt;
- БКИ — credit history, debt and delinquency data;
- АБС — accounts, balances, turnover and existing payments;
- ПЭП — simple electronic signature workflow and signing status.

Product and organization names are used only to describe compatibility or the
systems being simulated. No endorsement or affiliation is implied.
